 here is ALREADY decorated with RECONCILER_MARKER')","Send path is to_wire(fit_preserving_marker(DECORATED_body, codec.fit_outbound)) — fit AFTER decoration via the marker-preserving fitter; the fix does sanitizer.fit_comment(body) THEN _decorate_outbound_comment(...) — fit BEFORE decoration, and via sanitizer.fit_comment (backend.py:152) rather than fit_preserving_marker(..., codec.fit_outbound)","Plan's own Phase-1 root cause states the landed wire is 'to_wire(fit_preserving_marker(DECORATED body))', which matches the send path but NOT the fix expression"],"finding":"The plan's confident claim that the new local key predicts 'the exact wire the send path produces' is refuted by the send-path code: the fix expression composes decoration/fitting differently than acli_cli_ops.add_comment.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f14494e2c6bd43006","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Fix plan (one decoder) — proposed replacement expression","norm_id":"nd98a5d0c34ae62a2","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A markdown body near the length limit where fit-before-decorate vs decorate-then-fit_preserving_marker yield different truncation points, re-introducing key divergence for the exact case the fix targets"],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2222,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"no","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"no","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_unce